          "raw_rationale": "Field preservation on the labels resource through the center member creation: the before observer GET /ghost/api/admin/labels/ (limit=100, page=1, actor_a) and the after observer GET /ghost/api/admin/labels/ use the same observed operation and the same exact selector, with the member-creation write between them. The frozen field is the root field $.labels of that response object (value_type array). The two recorded response bodies are identical, but the relation is proposed as a freeze-and-recheck rule (settle plus a fresh API read at execution); no already-equal recording or negative request fact is required.",
